d on  thursday  she backlist trusts  were you disappointed not to get her  support well we're fighting for every  every every every colleague support i'll  be on the phones later talking to  colleagues to try and convince people  that kemi is the right person and we're  getting some really good feedback on  that specifically  so well there's a friend she's a friend  of kemmies people have to make their own  decisions i mean you can't you can't  make half a decision suella's made the  decision she's written about that today  but i disagree with her and i disagree  that's why i didn't join her campaign in  the first place so i didn't absolutely  agree with some of the things she was  saying but that's part of the debate and  it's why i'm absolutely committed to  getting kevin into the final two as much  as i can do and then kenny can make her  case to the members and then in times  the british people as prime minister  i'm quite intrigued about where kemi  boyd baden knocks support could go if  she is knocked out i know that you're  going to say we're fighting to the final  two we wanted to get to the next prime  minister but there is obviously a chance  that she is eliminated in one of the  earlier rounds you know some would like  to see her throw her weight behind liz  trust we've heard lord frost say that  for example  but there are rumors that actually she  may be more likely to roll in behind  rishi sunak well you're absolutely right  i'm going to say that kemi is in it to  win it because she is because  we said to kemi when a group of us when  kenny was saying that she thought she  was thinking about doing this we said if  you're going to do it do it to win and  we'll back you and that's why i'm here  today and it's why i've been trying to  help on the campaign for the last 10  days she is really serious about this  there is so many issues in our country  we've got to change it and my personal  view is we've got to change it with a  fresh start the um i guess on